<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed} from 'vue'
const props=defineProps<{view:string;product:any;metrics:any}>()
const percent=(value:number,total:number)=>total?((value/total)*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'暂无'
const points=computed(()=>{const rows=props.product.activeDays,max=Math.max(1,...rows.map((r:any)=>r.activeUsers));return rows.map((r:any,i:number)=>`${20+i*720/Math.max(1,rows.length-1)},${170-r.activeUsers/max*140}`).join(' ')})
</script>
<template>
<template v-if="view==='dashboard'"><div class="panel"><h2>近 30 天每日活跃人数</h2><svg role="img" aria-label="近30天每日活跃人数折线图" viewBox="0 0 760 210" style="width:100%;max-width:900px"><line x1="20" y1="170" x2="740" y2="170" stroke="#87978d"/><polyline :points="points" fill="none" stroke="#176b61" stroke-width="3"/><text x="20" y="200" font-size="12">{{ product.activeDays[0]?.day }}</text><text x="630" y="200" font-size="12">{{ product.activeDays.at(-1)?.day }}</text></svg><details><summary>查看每日数值</summary><table><thead><tr><th>日期</th><th>活跃用户</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in product.activeDays" :key="r.day"><td>{{ r.day }}</td><td>{{ r.activeUsers }}</td></tr></tbody></table></details></div><div class="panel"><h2>更替统计</h2><p>已确认更替 {{ metrics.replacement.confirmed }} 次 · 涉及用户 {{ metrics.replacement.involvedUsers }} 人 · 链式占比 {{ percent(metrics.replacement.chained,metrics.replacement.confirmed) }}</p><p class="muted">涉及用户按账号去重；链式指一次更替的目标后续又被更替，按边数占比计算。</p></div></template>
<template v-if="view==='content'"><div class="panel scroll"><h2>资讯互动与转化</h2><p class="muted">累计点击 / 累计有效曝光，仅作两个事件口径的比值，可大于100%；无曝光显示暂无。分享为发起分享。</p><table><thead><tr><th>资讯</th><th>点击</th><th>人数</th><th>收藏</th><th>分享</th><th>曝光</th><th>举报</th><th>点击/曝光</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in metrics.engagement" :key="r.id"><td>{{ r.title }}</td><td>{{ r.clicks }}</td><td>{{ r.viewers }}</td><td>{{ r.favorites }}</td><td>{{ r.shares }}</td><td>{{ r.exposures }}</td><td>{{ r.reports }}</td><td>{{ percent(r.clicks,r.exposures) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="panel scroll"><h2>活动报名</h2><table><thead><tr><th>活动</th><th>报名记录</th><th>名额</th><th>确认</th><th>满员率</th><th>候补</th><th>取消</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in metrics.activities" :key="r.id"><td>{{ r.title }}</td><td>{{ r.registrations }}</td><td>{{ r.capacity }}</td><td>{{ r.confirmed }}</td><td>{{ percent(r.confirmed,r.capacity) }}</td><td>{{ r.waitlisted }}</td><td>{{ r.cancelled }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="panel scroll"><h2>文件去重下载</h2><p class="muted">活动与文件分别统计。次数按用户、文件、活动、上海自然日去重；人数跨日去重。仅客户端确认成功取回后计数。</p><table><thead><tr><th>活动编号</th><th>文件</th><th>下载次数</th><th>用户数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in metrics.downloads" :key="r.activityId+r.fileId"><td>{{ r.activityId }}</td><td>{{ r.fileName }}</td><td>{{ r.downloads }}</td><td>{{ r.users }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="panel scroll"><h2>申报评审</h2><p class="muted">按申请当前状态统计，草稿计入申请总数。通过率=当前通过/（通过+驳回），补正和待审不作最终结论。</p><table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>申请</th><th>待审</th><th>通过</th><th>驳回</th><th>补正</th><th>通过率</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in metrics.reviews" :key="r.id"><td>{{ r.title }}</td><td>{{ r.applications }}</td><td>{{ r.submitted }}</td><td>{{ r.approved }}</td><td>{{ r.rejected }}</td><td>{{ r.correction }}</td><td>{{ percent(r.approved,r.approved+r.rejected) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></template>
</template>
